alkers</a> traverse the multiverse.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/multiverse/dominaria\" class=\"entity-link\">Dominaria</a>\n            — <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/multiverse/dominaria\" class=\"entity-link\">Dominaria</a> is a plane in the multiverse.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/multiverse/ravnica\" class=\"entity-link\">Ravnica</a>\n            — <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/multiverse/ravnica\" class=\"entity-link\">Ravnica</a> is a plane in the multiverse.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/multiverse/phyrexia\" class=\"entity-link\">Phyrexia</a>\n            — <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/multiverse/phyrexia\" class=\"entity-link\">Phyrexia</a> is a plane in the multiverse.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/multiverse/zendikar\" class=\"entity-link\">Zendikar</a>\n            — <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/multiverse/zendikar\" class=\"entity-link\">Zendikar</a> is a plane in the multiverse.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Site Of:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering/multiverse/phyrexia/phyrexian-invasion\" class=\"entity-link\">Phyrexian invasion of the Multiverse</a>\n            — The invasion struck planes across the multiverse.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering\" class=\"entity-link\">Magic: The Gathering</a>\n            — Magic multiverse is connected to <a href=\"/magic-the-gathering\" class=\"entity-link\">Magic: The Gathering</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Ev